<title>USA: Optical Sensors broadens device interface.</title>
<headline>Optical Sensors broadens device interface.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optical Sensors Inc said Monday its new OpticalCAM Blood Measurement System is now compatible with Hewlett-Packard Co's VueLink interface.</p>
<p>The OpticalCAM is a stand-alone arterial blood gas monitor.</p>
<p>The VueLink interface integrates data from the OpticalCAM monitor with Hewlett-Packard's patient monitoring systems.</p>
<p>Optical Sensors said it is showing its OpticlCAM at the American Society of Anesthesiologists annual meeting in New Orleans.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
